WEBVTT

00:08:28.083 --> 00:08:31.083
(Applause)

00:08:34.667 --> 00:08:38.143
And where there was no justice,

00:08:38.167 --> 00:08:39.792
she just built it.

00:08:41.167 --> 00:08:44.143
We all survived,

00:08:44.167 --> 00:08:48.000
because we stood on the shoulders
of our Black ancestors.

00:08:48.792 --> 00:08:54.625
We all thrived, because
Miss Ann was an unlikely ally.

00:08:55.667 --> 00:08:58.768
You know, when you add your voice

00:08:58.792 --> 00:09:00.934
and your actions